# Security requirements

- Validate all input; normalize and encode Riot IDs safely.
- Add API request limits for public endpoints; restrict CORS; use secure HTTP headers.
- Avoid logging personal identifiers unnecessarily.
- Prevent arbitrary SQL or database access by the AI agent.
- Store secrets only in environment variables; include `.env.example` without real secrets.
- Add dependency vulnerability checks.
- Do not commit generated secrets or local databases.
